  "description": "Yang Deok-woo dreams of escaping bullying and becoming a normal high school student. However, contrary to his wishes, he finds himself embroiled in a fight on his first day of school and ultimately becomes the leader of Class 8. Will Yang Deok-woo, who has never been in a fight, be able to survive among these powerful individuals? A coming-of-age story of young people trying to become the best, and Yang Deok-woo's struggle for survival.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
